+## Usages
+- Location 1: Template selector
+- Location 2: Menu bar
+- Location 3: Settings panel
+
+## Variations
+- Light theme: N/A
+- Dark theme: N/A
+- Hover state: N/A
+
+## Future considerations
+- Any planned changes?
