+## Data Model
+```ts
+interface ScenarioDebateData {
+  title: string;
+  scenario: string;
+  positionA: string;
+  positionB: string;
+  showOpposing?: boolean;
+  minChars?: number;
+}
+```
+
+## Preview Behavior
+- Position cards behave as exclusive choice.
+- Rationale field appears after selection.
+- Submit disabled until min chars reached.
+
+## Editor Behavior
